  <para style="h">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yakobo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Yakobo, Mawu kɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo sɔmɔlɔ ɔ ngma womi nɛ ɔ kɛ ya ha Yuda bi ɔmɛ a wɛtso nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ nɛ gbɛ fiã ngɛ he fɛɛ he ɔ ke: Nyɛ he manye!<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haomi woɔ tsui si tomi kɛ baa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Anyɛmimɛ, anɛ nyɛ ngɛ haomihi kɛ kahi nae ngɛ nyɛ si himi mi lo? Ke ja a, nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />Ejakaa ke a ka nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ; e haa nɛ nyɛ naa tsui si tomi. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ nyɛ na tsui si tomi nɛ ɔ kɛ pi si, nɛ nyɛ haomi ɔmɛ nɛ ko tsi nyɛ blɔ. Ejakaa ke nyɛ na tsui si tomi saminya a, lɔ ɔ loko ji nyɛ ma dla nyɛ he kɛ ha nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ, nɛ nyɛ je mi bami hu maa hi kɛ pi si. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Ke nile he hia nyɛ ti nɔ ko ɔ, e bi Mawu nɛ e ma ha lɛ, ejakaa e pee klaalo nɛ e ma ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ma bi lɛ ɔ faa. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Se mohu ji kaa jamɛatsɛ ɔ, e bi kɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ nɔ́ jemi be mi; ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ jee nɔ́ ɔ, e ngɛ kaa oslɔke ngɛ wo hɛ mi nɛ kɔɔhiɔ ngɛ lɛ fiae kɛ bee. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7-8" />Ejakaa juɛmi enyɔɔnyɔtsɛ ko nɛ ko hyɛ blɔ kaa e ma na nɔ́ ko kɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ dɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ nɛ a bui e he akɔtaa tsɔ ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi ɔ, e bua nɛ jɔ, ejakaa e kle ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10-11" />Nɛ niatsɛ ɔ e bua nɛ jɔ kaa e ni nami ɔ pi nɔ́ ko ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi, ejakaa e se be kɛe ngɛ je mi kaa bɔ nɛ nga mi mɔmɔ he fɛu laa, nɛ nyagbe mi ɔ pu la nglaa lɛ ɔ. Ja a nɛ niatsɛmɛ ngɛ. E be kɛe nɛ a ma gbo nɛ a ma si a ni tsumi slɔɔto ɔmɛ nɛ ha we mɛ deka a. <verse eid="JAS 1:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />A gbaa nɔ nɛ e nyɛɔ nɛ e daa kami nya; ejakaa ke pee se ɔ, e nine maa su e hiɔwo nɔ, nɛ ji wami jlasi ɔ nɛ Mawu wo he si kaa e ma ha ni nɛmɛ nɛ suɔ lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Nyɛ kai kaa ke nɔ ko ngɛ hlae nɛ e pee yayami ɔ, tsa pi Mawu nɛ ngɛ lɛ kae, ejakaa Mawu be suɔe nɛ e pee yayami, nɛ ja a kɛ e be nɔ ko hu kae kaa e pee yayami. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Nɔmlɔ adesa nitsɛ susumi yayahi kɛ akɔnɔ níhi nɛ woɔ kami kɛ baa e nɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Nɛ susumi yaya nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ nɔ́ yayami peemi baa, nɛ nyagbe mi ɔ, Mawu woɔ he hiɔ kɛ gbenɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, anyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ, nyɛ ko ha nɛ nɔ ko nɛ e sisi nyɛ.<verse eid="JAS 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu dɛ mi ni kpakpahi jee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Mawu ngɔ nɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ hi kɛ pi si ɔ jee kɛ baa ha wɔ. Lɛ ji la bɔlɔ, nɛ e kpɛɛ kɛ haa wɔ be tsuaa be, nɛ e tsakee we. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />E kɛ wɔ ba je mi ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e suɔmi nya kɛ gu e anɔkuale munyu ɔ nɔ, nɛ wɔ ji bɔ níhi tsuo a kpɛti kekle bimɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Anyɛmimɛ, nyɛɛ le enɛ ɔ: Nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e pee tue bulɔ, se e nya nɛ ko sɔ kɛ munyu tumi, nɛ e muklii mi hu nɛ ko fu mlamlaamla. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Ejakaa nɔmlɔ mi mi fumi ha we nɛ e tsuɔ suɔmi nya ni.<verse eid="JAS 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ je yayami kɛ je nyɛ si himi mi, nyɛ mi blɔ kɛ kpo nɔ blɔ tsuo, nɛ nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ nyakpɛ munyu ɔ nɛ wa nine su nɔ ɔ he kɛ he si bami, ejakaa lɛ nɛ e ma he wa klaahi a yi wami, ke e he wa tsuihi ɔ.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Nɛ nyɛɛ pee munyu ɔ nɔ yeli se pi e nuli kɛkɛ, nɛ nyɛ ko mlɔɔ nyɛ he. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Ejakaa nɔ ko nɛ nuɔ munyu ɔ se e yi nɔ ɔ, e ngɛ kaa nɔ ko nɛ hyɛɔ e hɛ mi ngɛ ahuhuɛ mi. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />E naa e he kɛkɛ e je; se amlɔ ɔ mi nɔuu ɔ, e hɛ jee bɔ nɛ e ngɛ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Se nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ hyɛɔ Mawu mlaa nɛ hi kɛ pi si, nɛ haa wa yeɔ wa he ɔ mi be fɛɛ be, tsa pi nɛ e ma kai mlaa a kɛkɛ, se e yeɔ nɔ ɔ, Mawu gbaa lɛ ngɛ e nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ peemi mi.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Ke nɔ ko tsɛɔ e he Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ se e tuɔ munyu kɛkɛ nɛ e kɔɛ e lilɛ mi ɔ, e ngɛ e he sisie, e jami ɔ he be se nami ko. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Mawu lemi nɛ hi kɛ pi si, nɛ mu ko be he ngɛ Mawu nɛ ji Tsɛ ɔ hɛ mi ɔ ji kaa, o maa hyɛ awusahi kɛ yalɔyihi a nɔ nɛ o maa ye Nutsɔ ɔ anɔkuale, o be je ɔ mi ní ɔmɛ woe kɛ wo o he mu.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ ko hla nimli a mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Anyɛmimɛ, kɛ maa pee kɛɛ nɛ nyɛ ma de ke Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɛ ji anunyami Nutsɔ ɔ ní ji nyɛ, ke nyɛ suɔ niatsɛmɛ se nyɛ sume ohiafohi.<verse eid="JAS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Ejakaa ke ji niatsɛ nɛ wo sika tsu nguɛ ga kɛ e he afɛu tade ba nyɛ he nya buami he, nɛ ohiafo hu ba kɛ e he tade yaya, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />nɛ nyɛ he niatsɛ ɔ kɛ bumi nɛ nyɛ de lɛ ke, “Taflatsɛ, o sɛ ji enɛ,” se nyɛ de ohiafo ɔ lɛɛ ke, “Moo da si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ” aloo “Moo hi si ngɛ zugba” a nɛɛ, <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />anɛ nyɛ hlɛ nimli a mi lo, nɛ nyɛ wo we juɛmi nɛ dɛ kɛ kojo we lo?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Anyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ, nyɛɛ bu mi tue, Mawu hla ni nɛmɛ nɛ be nɔ́ ko ngɛ je mi ɔmɛ nɛ e pee mɛ niatsɛmɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi mi, nɛ Hiɔwe Matsɛyemi ɔ peeɔ a nɔ, ejakaa ja a ji bɔ nɛ e wo he si kaa e maa ngɔ kɛ ha ni nɛmɛ nɛ suɔ lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ bui ohiafo kɛ ha nɔ́ ko. Tsa pi niatsɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a waa nyɛ yi mi nɛ a woɔ nyɛ kɛ yaa sane yemi he ɔmɛ ɔ lo? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Tsa pi mɛ nɛ a muɔɔ Yesu Kristo, nɔ nɛ biɛ nɛ a kɛ tsɛɔ nyɛ ɔ lo?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Ke nyɛ ye wa Nutsɔ ɔ mlaa nɛ e wo ngɛ Ngmami ɔ mi nɔ, nɛ deɔ ke, “Moo suɔ o nyɛmi nɛ o ye kɛ bua lɛ kaa bɔ nɛ o suɔ mo nitsɛ o he nɛ o hyɛɔ o he nɔ” ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ pee saminya. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Se ke nyɛ hla nihi a mi, nɛ nyɛ hyɛ nihi a hɛ mi pɛ, nyɛ pee yayami nɛ nyɛ tɔ Nutsɔ ɔ mlaa a nɔ.<verse eid="JAS 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ yeɔ Mawu mlaa amɛ kulaa a nɔ se e tɔɔ a mi kake too nɔ ɔ, e ngɛ kaa nɔ nɛ tɔ mlaa amɛ tsuo nɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Ejakaa nɔ nɛ de ke, “Mo ko bɔ ajuama” a, lɛ kɛ nɛ e de ke, “Mo ko gbe nɔmlɔ.” Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke o bɔɛ ajuama se o gbe nɔmlɔ pɛ o pee Mawu mlaa a nɔ tɔlɔ.<verse eid="JAS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi ngɛ nyɛ ni peemi ni kɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ susuu mi, kaa nihi nɛ a maa kojo mɛ kaa a ye Kristo mlaa amɛ a nɔ aloo a yi nɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Nɛ nihi nɛ a nɛ mɔbɔ ɔ, a be mɛ mɔbɔ nae, se nihi nɛ naa mɔbɔ ɔ, Mawu mɔbɔ nami ɔ maa ye kojomi nɛ e maa kojo mɛ ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hemi kɛ yemi kɛ ni tsumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Anyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ, mɛni se nami nɛ ngɛ he, ke nyɛ ma de ke Kristo se nyɛɛli ji nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi, se nyɛ yi kɛ bua we ni kpahi konɛ nyɛ kɛ tsɔɔ ja. Anɛ jamɛ a hemi kɛ yemi ma nyɛ nɔ ko yi wami ma he lo? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Ke ji nyɛminyumu loo nyɛmiyo ko he bo gba nɛ e be nɔ́ ko hu nɛ e yeɔ, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />nɛ nyɛ ti nɔ ko de lɛ ke, “Moo ya ngɛ he jɔmi mi, fiɛ nɛ ko ye mo, nɛ hwɔ hu nɛ ko ye mo”, se e ha we lɛ níhi nɛ a he ngɛ lɛ hiae ɔ nɛɛ, mɛni se nami nɛ ngɛ he lo?<verse eid="JAS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, pi hemi kɛ yemi kɛkɛ nɛ he hia, se mohu e he hia kaa nyɛɛ pee kpakpa hulɔ nɛ nyɛ kɛ tsɔɔ kaa nyɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi. Hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ni tsumi piɛ we he ɔ, e ji hemi kɛ yemi nɛ he be se nami ko.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Se nɔ ko ma de ke, “O de ke hemi kɛ yemi kɛkɛ nɛ a kɛ naa Mawu se blɔ, nɛ nɔ́ ko piɛ we he hu. Se i ngɛ dee ke, ni tsumi kpakpa hu he hia, ejakaa ke ni tsumi kpakpa piɛ we he ɔ, o be nyɛe maa tsɔɔ kaa o ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi, se kɛ gu ye nɔ́ peepee mi ɔ, nɔ ko maa na kaa i ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi.”<verse eid="JAS 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Anɛ ni komɛ ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti kɛ sa nɛ deɔ ke hemi kɛ yemi kɛkɛ hiɛ lo? Mawu kake ɔ nɔ hemi kɛ yemi? Se nyɛ kai kaa mumi yayahi hu heɔ enɛ ɔ yeɔ kɛ gbeye kɛ he kpokpomi. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Mɛni be o maa le kaa hemi kɛ yemi gu he be se nami ke o pee we nɔ nɛ Mawu ngɛ hlae ɔ kɛ piɛ we he. Hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ni tsumi kpakpa ji mi ɔ, e pi anɔkuale hemi kɛ yemi.<verse eid="JAS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />O kai we kaa nɔ́ nɛ wa tsɛ Abraham tsu, kaa e bu Mawu tue nɛ e ngɔ e bi Isak nɛ e ma kɛ sã bɔ ɔ, he je nɛ a bu lɛ dalɔ ɔ lo? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />O maa na kaa hemi kɛ yemi he je nɛ e suɔ nɛ e maa pee nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ Mawu de lɛ ɔ nɛ; nɛ kɛ gu nɔ́ nɛ e tsu ɔ nɔ ɔ, e hemi kɛ yemi ɔ hyi obɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Nɛ Mawu munyu nɛ de ke, “Nɛ Abraham he Mawu ye nɛ enɛ ɔ ha nɛ e bu lɛ dalɔ” ɔ ba mi. Nɛ a tsɛ lɛ Mawu huɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Enɛ ɔ ma ha nɛ nyɛ maa na kaa nɔ ni tsumihi hu a nɔ nɛ a daa kɛ heɔ e yi wami, se pi e hemi kɛ yemi pɛ kɛkɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Nɛ ja a kɛ̃ nɛ a da Rahab ajuamatsɛ ɔ ni peemi nɔ, kaa e ngɔ tsɔli ɔmɛ ngɔ laa nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ blɔ kpa kɛ ho ɔ, nɛ a kɛ he e yi wami. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Ejakaa, kaa bɔ nɛ ke mumi ɔ be nɔmlɔ tso ɔ mi pɛ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ peeɔ nɔ gbogboe ɔ, ja a kɛ̃ nɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ni tsumi kpakpa piɛ we he ɔ, peeɔ hemi kɛ yemi gbogboe.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ munyu tumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Anyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ, nyɛ ti nihi fuu ngɛ nɛ e sɛ kaa a woɔ tsɔɔmi ni tsumi ngɔ fɔɔ a nɔ, ejakaa hwɔɔ se ɔ a maa kojo wɔ tsɔɔli ɔmɛ wawɛɛ pe ni nɛmɛ nɛ piɛ ɔmɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Ejakaa wɔ tsuo wa peeɔ tɔmihi fuu. Ke nɔ ko ngɛ nɛ e tɔ we ngɛ e munyu tumi mi ɔ, kɛkɛ lɛɛ nɔmlɔ nɛ hi kɛ pi si ji lɛ, nɛ e ma nyɛ maa ye e nɔmlɔ tso ɔ tsuo nɔ. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Wa woɔ okpɔngɔ nya mi ga kɛ e se kpa bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e ya he tsuaa he nɛ wa ma kudɔ lɛ kɛ ya a. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Jehanɛ ɔ hu nɔ́ nyafii ko pɛ nɛ lɛ kudɔlɔ kɛ daa lɛ agbo ɔ yi kɛ yaa he fɛɛ he nɛ e ngɛ hlae, ke kɔɔhiɔ nya wa tete po.<verse eid="JAS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Ja a nɛ wa lilɛ nɛ ngɛ wa nya mi ɔ ngɛ nyafii se e yeɔ awi agbo. Mo kai hu kaa la nyafii nyɛɔ nɛ e saa hue tso agbo. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Nɛ wa lilɛ ngɛ kaa la. E tsuɔ yi mi wami ni nɛ e kɛ duɔ woɔ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he fɛɛ he. Abosiamihi a je a woɔ lilɛ ɔ he wami kɛ jee nɛ e ma nyɛ kpata wa wami tsuo hɛ mi.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Nɔmlɔ nyɛɔ nɛ e lɛɛ nga mi lohwehi kɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi kɛ zugba lohwehi kɛ wo mi lohwe slɔɔtohi nɛ a he jɔɔ kaa we mi lohwehi. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Se nɔmlɔ ko be nyɛe maa jɔɔ lilɛ nɛ pee klaalo nɛ e kɛ e duɔ ma tsu nɔ́ yaya a he. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Lilɛ kake nɛ ɔ nɔuu nɛ wa kɛ jeɔ wa hiɔwe Tsɛ ɔ yi, nɛ lɛ kɛ be komɛ ɔ, wa kɛ gbiɛɛ nimli adesahi nɛ Mawu bɔ ngɛ e subai nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Nya kake ɔ mi nɛ gbaami kɛ gbiɛmi tsuo jee. Anyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ, e sɛ kaa e baa mi ja. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Anɛ vu kake mi ɔ, a naa nyu mua be komɛ, nɛ be kpa komɛ hu ngo nyu lo? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Mangoo tso te nɔ́ nɛ woɔ ayɔ loo tso yiblii kpa ko nɛɛ? Ja a kɛ̃ nɛ ngo nyu vu be mo nyu mua nyɛɛ ma ha.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Nyɛ ti mɛnɔ nɛ hine ni lelɔ nɛ nuɔ nɔ sisi? Jamɛatsɛ ɔ e hi si himi kpakpa bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e ni peemi ni kpakpahi a je kpo nɛ a na. Nɛ ke ji e wo we kɛ fiɛ ɔ, lɛɛ ni lelɔ ji lɛ niinɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Se ke hunga jemi kɛ e hi ha ami nɔ kake mumi ngɛ nyɛ tsui mi ɔ, nyɛ ko fia kaa nyɛ le ni, nɛ nimli kpakpahi ji nyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Ejakaa hunga jemi kɛ e hi ha ami nɔ kake pi Mawu dɛ mi nile. A ji je mi nile, nɛ pi mumi mi nile, se nile nɛ je abosiami dɛ mi. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Ejakaa he tsuaa he nɛ hunga kɛ e hi ha ami nɔ kake mumi ngɛ ɔ, basabasa kɛ nɔ́ yayami peemi tɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="JAS 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Se nile nɛ je hiɔwe ngɛ nyaii, pɛ be mi, e he jɔ, e nuɔ nɔ́ sisi, e naa mɔbɔ nɛ e woɔ yiblii kpakpa; juɛmi enyɔɔnyɔ be e mi nɛ e yeɔ anɔkuale. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Nɛ nihi nɛ ji pɛ kpatali ji nihi nɛ ma du tue mi jɔmi nami wuhi nɛ a ma kpa yiblii kpakpahi.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mɛni ha nyɛ kpɛti jɔɛ ɔ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Mɛni ha nɛ pɛ kɛ kunɔ ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti ɔ? Tsa pi juɛmi yayamihi nɛ nyɛ hɛɛ ɔ nɛ ha we nɛ nyɛ kpɛti nɛ jɔ ɔ lo? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Nyɛ hɛ tsuɔ ngɛ nihi a níhi a he nɛ nyɛ gbee mɛ konɛ nyɛ nine nɛ su nɔ. Nyɛ he kɔɔ nihi a níhi a nɔ, se nyɛ nine nyɛ we nɛ e suu nɔ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ nyɛ nɔɔ kunɔ nɛ nyɛ kpɔɔ ngɛ a dɛ. Se nɔ́ nɛ he je nɛ nyɛ na we nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae ɔ ji kaa nyɛ bi we Mawu. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Nɛ ke nyɛ bi tete ɔ, nyɛ nine sui nɔ, ejakaa nyɛ bi we nɔ́ nɛ sa, nyɛ biɔ akɔnɔ níhi sɔuu.<verse eid="JAS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Nyɛ ngɛ kaa yo nɛ anɔkuale be e mi nɛ suɔ e huno he nyɛli. Nyɛ li kaa ke nɔ ko suɔ je ɔ mi akɔnɔ ni ɔmɛ nɛ Mawu sume ɔ, jamɛ a nɔ ɔ peeɔ Mawu he nyɛlɔ lo? Nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee ekohu ke, ke nyɛ susumi ji kaa nyɛ maa di je nɛ ɔ mi akɔnɔ ni ɔmɛ a se ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ be Mawu suɔli pee. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Nɛ mɛni nyɛ susu kaa Ngmami ɔ ngɛ tsɔɔe benɛ e de ke, “Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ Mawu kɛ wo wa mi ɔ buu wa he nɛ e jee wa he hunga” a? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Se e haa wɔ he wami bɔ nɛ sa nɛ wa kɛ ye akɔnɔ ni nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ. Kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ɔ, “Mawu haa humi he wami, se fialɔ kɛ he nɔ wolɔ lɛɛ e kɛ lɛ kpee.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si ha Mawu. Nyɛɛ te si kɛ si abosiami nɛ e maa tu nyɛ nya fo. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Nyɛɛ sa kɛ su Mawu he nɛ e maa sa kɛ su nyɛ he. Nyɛ tsake nyɛ tsui, nyɛ yayami peeli, nɛ nyɛɛ nyɛɛ Mawu kɛkɛ se konɛ nyɛ tsui mi nɛ tsɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye lɛ anɔkuale. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Nyɛ fo ya nɛ nyɛ pia nyɛ he ngɛ nyɛ yayami ɔmɛ a he. Nyɛ ko nya, se mohu nyɛɛ ye kɔmɔ kɛ aywilɛho ngɛ anɔkuale mi.<verse eid="JAS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Nɛ ke nyɛ le kaa nyɛ he be se nami ko ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi ɔ, lɛɛ e ma wo nyɛ nɔ nɛ e maa ye kɛ bua nyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Anyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ, nyɛ ko tu munyu kɛ si nyɛ bi, nɛ nyɛ ko tu nyɛ bi a he munyu yaya hulɔ. Ke nyɛ pee ja a nyɛ ngɛ Mawu mlaa nɛ tsɔɔ kaa nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he ɔ nɔ tɔe, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa mlaa a dɛ. Tsa pi nyɛ blɔ nya ni tsumi ji kaa nyɛɛ kojo nɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ ha kaa mlaa a da aloo e dɛ. Nyɛ nɔ́ ji kaa nyɛɛ ye nɔ. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Mlaa halɔ ɔ pɛ ji nɔ nɛ kojoɔ wɔ ngɛ blɔ dadɛ nɔ. Lɛ pɛ ji nɔ nɛ nyɛɔ heɔ yi wami aloo e kpataa nɔ hɛ mi. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, mɛni he blɔ o ngɛ kaa o kojoɔ aloo o tuɔ munyu kɛ siɔ ni kpahi?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Jehanɛ ɔ, nyɛɛ bu tue, nyɛ nihi nɛ nyɛ deɔ ke, “Mwɔnɛ ɔ loo hwɔɔ ɔ, wa maa ya ma nɛ ɔ loo ma kɔlɔ ɔ mi nɛ wa ma ya ye jeha kake nɛ waa ye jua” a. <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Kɛ nyɛ pee kɛ le nɔ́ nɛ maa ba hwɔɔ kɛɛ? Ejakaa nyɛ wami be ɔmɛ ɔ nyɛ li a se kɛmi, a ngɛ kaa mɔtu afua. Nyɛ maa na lɛ piɔ, se be bɔɔ se pɛ e be hu. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Bɔ nɛ sa nɛ nyɛ de ji, “Ke Tsɛ ɔ bli wɔ saminya a, wa maa pee enɛ ɔ loo enɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Se ke pi ja a, nyɛ maa hi fiae kɛ fɔ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ blɔ nya tomihi a nɔ, nɛ kikɛmɛ a fiami nɛ ɔ sɛ Mawu hɛ mi.<verse eid="JAS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Nyɛ kai hu kaa ke o le nɔ nɛ hi, nɛ sa nɛ o pee, se o pee we ɔ, e ji yayami ha mo.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Niatsɛmɛ a kɔkɔ bɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Nyɛɛ bu tue, nyɛ niatsɛmɛ, nyɛɛ wo ya nɛ nyɛ fo ngɛ haomihi nɛ ma nyɛ nɔ ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Nyɛ ní ɔmɛ ngɛ puɛe nɛ lohwe tsɔwi hu ngɛ nyɛ he hami ni kpakpa amɛ yee. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Nyɛ sika tsu kɛ sika hiɔ ɔmɛ a he jua ngɛ gboe, se kɛ ɔ, lɔ ɔmɛ nɛ a maa ngɔ kɛ ye odase kɛ si nyɛ, nɛ e maa sa nyɛ kaa la. Ejakaa lɔ ɔmɛ ji níhi nɛ nyɛ bua nya kɛ to kɛ ha nyɛ he ngɛ kojomi ligbi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Nyɛɛ bu tue! Nyɛ maa nu ni nɛmɛ nɛ nyɛ bɔ mɛ apaa ngɛ nyɛ ngmɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ se nyɛ wui mɛ hiɔ bɔ nɛ sa amɛ a ngmlaa. A ngmlaa ba su Nutsɔ ɔ tue mi.<verse eid="JAS 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Nyɛ na nyɛ he nɛ nyɛ hi kpɔtɔɔ mi ngɛ zugba a nɔ, nɛ nyɛ na he mi kaa lohwe nɛ a to nɛ wo zɔ nɛ a maa gbe. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Nyɛ bu dali nɛ be he fami ko ɔ gbenɔ fɔ nɛ nyɛ gbe mɛ.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ye nyɛmimɛ, nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ bami ɔ blɔ hyɛe ɔ, nyɛɛ to tsui kaa bɔ nɛ ngmɔ hulɔ toɔ tsui kɛ guu gbiɛ kɛ gbo mi kɛ ya siɔ be nɛ ngmɔ ni ɔ woɔ yiblii nɛ e waa kɛ ha kpami. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Ja a kɛ nyɛ hu nyɛɛ to nyɛ tsui si, ejakaa Nutsɔ ɔ bami be ɔ su ta.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Nyɛmimɛ, nyɛ ko tu munyu kɛ si nyɛ bi. Anɛ nyɛ susuu kaa nyɛɛ lɛɛ nɔ́ ko be nɛ a ma de ngɛ nyɛ he lo? Nyɛ nɛ, kojolɔ ngua a ma, nɛ e su si ta.<verse eid="JAS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Nyɛ ha nɛ gbali ɔmɛ a tsui si tomi ngɛ a nɔ́ nami mi ɔ e pee nɔ hyɛmi nɔ́ kɛ ha nyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Wa le kaa amlɔ nɛ ɔ, a na bua jɔmi, ejakaa a ye lɛ anɔkuale nɛ a na nɔ́ wawɛɛ. Nyɛ nu Hiob he kɛ bɔ nɛ e ya nɔ nɛ e he Nutsɔ ɔ ye ngɛ e haomi mi. Nɛ Hiob sane ɔ tsɔɔ wɔ bɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ blɔ nya tomi woɔ nɔ́ kpakpa kɛ baa ngɛ nyagbe mi.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Se nɔ́ nɛ pe kulaa ji, ye nyɛmimɛ, nyɛ ko ka kita. Nyɛ ko ka hiɔwe, nyɛ ko ka zugba; nyɛ ko ka nɔ́ ko kulaa. Se mohu nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ma de kɛkɛ ji, Ee loo dabi. Bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ ko pee yayami nɛ a bu nyɛ fɔ ngɛ he.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsami kɛ yemi ke buami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Anɛ nyɛ ti nɔ ko ngɛ nɔ́ nami mi lo? E hɛɛ sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami mi. Nɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ bua jɔmi mi ɔ, a la yi jemi la kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Anɛ nyɛ ti nɔ ko ngɛ hiɔ nue lo? E ha nɛ a tsɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ a pɔ lɛ nu ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ mi nɛ a sɔle kɛ ha lɛ. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Nɛ ke e sɔle kɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ, e ma na he wami, ejakaa Nutsɔ o ma tsa lɛ; nɛ ke ji yayami ko nɛ e pee he je nɛ e na hiɔ ɔ, Nutsɔ ɔ ma ngɔ ke lɛ.<verse eid="JAS 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Nyɛɛ jaje nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ si bi; nɛ nyɛɛ sɔle ha nyɛ bi nɛ nyɛ ma na tsami. Dalɔ sɔlemi ngɛ he wami nɛ e tsuɔ nyakpɛ níhi fuu.<verse eid="JAS 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Elia ji nɔmlɔ adesa kaa wɔ nɔuu, se e sɔle wawɛɛ nɛ hiɔmi nɛ e ko nɛ, nɛ niinɛ hiɔmi nɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ jeha etɛ kɛ hlami ekpa sɔuu. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Nɛ e kpale sɔle ekohu ke hiɔmi nɛ e nɛ, nɛ hiɔmi nɛ, nɛ zugba a ba ni.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Ye nyɛmimɛ, ke nyɛ ti nɔ ko kpale ngɛ Mawu se, nɛ e he we Nutsɔ ɔ yi hu, nɛ nɔ ko ha nɛ e kpale kɛ ba Anɔkuale blɔ ɔ nɔ ekohu ɔ, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />nɔ nɛ kpale jamɛ a yayami peelɔ ɔ kɛ ba Mawu ngɔ ekohu ɔ, e he e yi wami kɛ je gbenɔ mi, nɛ a maa ngɔ e he yayami babauu ɔ kɛ ke lɛ.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>